# No Cursor commit trailers

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any other Cursor/agent co-author trailer) to git commits.

Commit messages stay the author's. Do not append Cursor, Copilot, or coding-agent `Co-authored-by` lines.
